# Feature branches

- Non-trivial work uses a `feature/<slug>` branch — do not land it directly on `main`.
- Keep CI green before merging to `main`.
- Prefer squash merge; land under the CI merge gate; then return to up-to-date `main`.

**Authority:** [`CONTRIBUTING.md`](../../CONTRIBUTING.md) (feature-branch policy, land and return, CI merge gate).
